  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00041",
      "source_hash": "0adc5aea0b46d93f01d74e1dfd1127bef91373398b198fa7261bddbaddb9a308",
      "target_id": "XML:2703339",
      "text": "该行为的关联性，以及丢失、被盗、泄露、伪造、篡改或损坏的规模"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00042",
      "source_hash": "98ac42a5331bb6cc9fefea7d97e729587fafe32e634658c15e37cad727b71c2d",
      "target_id": "XML:2703340",
      "text": "丁）个人信息处理者所处理的个人信息类型及其对信息主体造成的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00043",
      "source_hash": "5528424f5f612845dbac705e03747bbed905bb647c60222cdb75d30007608ff9",
      "target_id": "XML:2703341",
      "text": "影响"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00044",
      "source_hash": "cbce1719691a4d76c9f2c1f31bfdba1d42a91375149c6753b793d8cd538f00f4",
      "target_id": "XML:2703342",
      "text": "戊）违法行为给信息主体造成的损害规模"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00045",
      "source_hash": "5fe14e36464bf1615bc44581a67de7a93834eac90305851b32f7218eb826bdb8",
      "target_id": "XML:2703343",
      "text": "乙. 第一次调整"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00046",
      "source_hash": "2ba71252915cd4101bef60a104468f3856ec7175652cdb563f49de8734e7a036",
      "target_id": "XML:2703344",
      "text": "考虑违法行为的持续期间及次数、通过违法行为取得的利益规模、个人信息"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00047",
      "source_hash": "5ed5d274f577a15f2617c60a03adf05c129eb0f479190ab43561ebae1a7b2bfc",
      "target_id": "XML:2703345",
      "text": "处理者业务的类型及规模，可以依保护委员会规定并公告的标准，在甲目规定的基准金额90%"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00048",
      "source_hash": "2fb6c5b2c2d3981c17f3bab2cd2df49fd685f57e80df668f68a1b2a95b829bc3",
      "target_id": "XML:2703346",
      "text": "的范围内予以加重或减轻。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00050",
      "source_hash": "5978a79bc4214f7768c39e00540b31ce3c9ab33e5971f34d9fb91883742b704e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703348",
      "text": "丙. 第二次调整"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00051",
      "source_hash": "28c9bb4e9e6436ffe5c18fb85843a7fa1d55bbd17fff5d459d54166476a0b12d",
      "target_id": "XML:2703349",
      "text": "综合考虑以下事项（但排除本法第六十四条之二第四款各号规定事项中，已在甲目基准金额计算"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00052",
      "source_hash": "a01974aa2419710643226353817070844ef9fc1c665960c3dff3b17d6d1edb26",
      "target_id": "XML:2703350",
      "text": "及乙目第一次调整阶段考虑的事项），"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00053",
      "source_hash": "e69dc20a2d164c516ff62fcb03ee2321217c780a637eb7889246a8bfd68c4208",
      "target_id": "XML:2703351",
      "text": "可以依保护委员会规定并公告的标准，在第一次调整后金额50%"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00054",
      "source_hash": "a6bab8aca23781eae7dfa7ac1729c8348b901a253fb52eba3c87a1741351cdfc",
      "target_id": "XML:2703352",
      "text": "的范围内予以加重或减轻。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00055",
      "source_hash": "fc26fa7d70719f5edff9e4a317fd14d30386d61cb5608dfd3b2c87ff9a1eebfd",
      "target_id": "XML:2703353",
      "text": "1）是否采取与保护委员会合作等纠正违法行为的措施"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00056",
      "source_hash": "b863f9842a6aaa995fbadc1286a07b23a1acf510b4517e3a2ab08d2c767cda60",
      "target_id": "XML:2703354",
      "text": "2）是否采取恢复违法行为所致损害及防止损害扩大的措施"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00057",
      "source_hash": "044816f33be8be79eb31f8862d0be879ff54ebff751edb8b8e0e5d1d23bdfc79",
      "target_id": "XML:2703355",
      "text": "3）为保护个人信息所作努力，如个人信息保护认证及自主保护活动"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00058",
      "source_hash": "f55488205ea7b9b6fc1aa15ea599309c793f2499b45dfd1fba61608d4317438e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703356",
      "text": "4）是否主导违法行为"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00059",
      "source_hash": "8a8a2ac5718074ec4ff9cdd8307d5896029dbffa7033a1a5467859e9b3db278c",
      "target_id": "XML:2703357",
      "text": "5）是否主动申报违法事实"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00060",
      "source_hash": "33ce4d253253682155d28d24bd789ab9b135c9fa9e9642b0c8742117736588bd",
      "target_id": "XML:2703358",
      "text": "丁. 限制减轻罚款附加金"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00061",
      "source_hash": "818d1dd1052b4e0b9f3e59baab049ae3ce36983083c9a49064331cee926c8bc0",
      "target_id": "XML:2703359",
      "text": "尽管有乙目和丙目的规定，违法行为属于甲目规定的非常严重的违法行为时，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00062",
      "source_hash": "d0245cde80f6b3fe07dc700e4d5bda38fb46627e0a5283f12ff3bd54dd92ee1f",
      "target_id": "XML:2703360",
      "text": "可不适用第一次调整及第二次调整所计算的全部或部分"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00063",
      "source_hash": "e844e1611f258248cb42fffbdc49ff5f4d60a67ec6c2ac9b11ca6e2070cf7d86",
      "target_id": "XML:2703361",
      "text": "减轻额度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00064",
      "source_hash": "49a68dd8e599176208270d05b0a8b9fdaf7b4a96e8089586d58c8925fbe5aa77",
      "target_id": "XML:2703362",
      "text": "戊. 确定应征收的罚款附加金"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00065",
      "source_hash": "390668b45d0ba23947c97b01ab14b9741e629fae18675520fab8247cdc4f3816",
      "target_id": "XML:2703363",
      "text": "1）综合考虑以下事项，认定依丙目计算的罚款附加金过重时，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00066",
      "source_hash": "12ed4d1f2008d1d6d334f330eb973f872ec914861d371b3d1df802ade7e36624",
      "target_id": "XML:2703364",
      "text": "可在相应金额90%的范围内减轻。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00067",
      "source_hash": "75ee84781ebcdadbabe031643c5bddbeac50c60af43d83d39a3dbe695a8debed",
      "target_id": "XML:2703365",
      "text": "甲）违法行为人的实际负担能力"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00068",
      "source_hash": "a1bb18d08a004577c7733f57aa35d89f01e890087247cee6c8a31909d0cc07e2",
      "target_id": "XML:2703366",
      "text": "乙）违法行为人所属市场或产业条件因经济危机等发生显著变化，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00069",
      "source_hash": "a4074cdc3a518cfc93e34c88a695f151e29823ff1a0bebf521a7fee3f3eaa649",
      "target_id": "XML:2703367",
      "text": "或者持续恶化的情形"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00070",
      "source_hash": "73719a44feb5c4c8442747aa8f5cbba80e45cf3d65514683233a1bee68984fac",
      "target_id": "XML:2703368",
      "text": "2）属于本法第六十四条之二第五款各号之一的情形时，可以"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00071",
      "source_hash": "a8306d21ece055df31a25a9d62f6bbde942d942031359b93a5cf97ae480b0305",
      "target_id": "XML:2703369",
      "text": "不征收罚款附加金。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00072",
      "source_hash": "468fb85373f35f8dfc4c8a0cfa3c640969d7cfb268c3f35d969ba701f9f7e588",
      "target_id": "XML:2703370",
      "text": "3. 具体标准"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00073",
      "source_hash": "df58a476a7387510430156fa079f632bbc1da60285c90c3996a50968201798b0",
      "target_id": "XML:2703371",
      "text": "有关销售额计算的具体标准、违法行为严重程度判断标准、第一次及"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00074",
      "source_hash": "4e4fb494c0cf44de21578918f30ebaa29068248a5acef940a56ffaed26879fa4",
      "target_id": "XML:2703372",
      "text": "第二次调整的具体标准、限制减轻罚款附加金的具体标准、确定应征收罚款附加金"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00075",
      "source_hash": "632da3c9cfe8afd5c8b8295f6d21d45e6f545bb11d9a143986069264dd10fec5",
      "target_id": "XML:2703373",
      "text": "的具体标准，以及征收罚款附加金所需的其他事项，由保护委员会"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00076",
      "source_hash": "ad08da80f89723e7f84a7d98805ae2cc4f5963518c9ff392694e4e26fa3397fa",
      "target_id": "XML:2703374",
      "text": "规定并公告。"
    }
  ],
  "note": "A37056 41-76 checked full Korean source, corrected START marker, 90% first adjustment, 50% second, factors, permitted reduction, and opposite-meaning non-imposition under 64-2(5). All 76 annex rows checked; family still partial."
